    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        TreePO: Bridging the Gap of Policy Optimization and Efficacy and <span class="search-hit mathjax">Inference</span> Efficiency with Heuristic Tree-based Modeling
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Y">Yizhi Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gu%2C+Q">Qingshui Gu</a>, 
      
