        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.14302">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2508.14302">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2508.14302">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
