        Multi-Rationale Explainable Object Recognition via Contrastive Conditional <span class="search-hit mathjax">Inference</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Rasekh%2C+A">Ali Rasekh</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ranjbar%2C+S+K">Sepehr Kazemi Ranjbar</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gottschalk%2C+S">Simon Gottschalk</a>
      
